# Security Guide

## ScanGuard AI – DevSecOps Security Command Center

---

# 1. Overview

Security is the foundation of the ScanGuard AI platform. The project adopts a **DevSecOps** approach by integrating automated security checks into the software delivery pipeline. Instead of identifying vulnerabilities after deployment, security validation occurs continuously during development and build processes.

The platform combines static code analysis, secret detection, container vulnerability scanning, pipeline automation, and monitoring to improve software quality and reduce deployment risks.

---

# 2. Security Objectives

The primary security objectives of this project are:

- Detect vulnerabilities early in the development lifecycle
- Prevent accidental exposure of secrets
- Identify vulnerable operating system and application packages
- Improve source code quality
- Automate security validation
- Provide centralized visibility through dashboards
- Support informed deployment decisions

