# 14. Conclusion

The ScanGuard AI platform demonstrates how DevSecOps practices can be integrated into a modern CI/CD pipeline using open-source tools. By combining automated security scanning, code quality analysis, vulnerability assessment, centralized reporting, and continuous monitoring, the platform enables teams to identify and address security risks before software reaches production.

The project provides a practical foundation that can be extended with additional security capabilities as future requirements evolve.
